<section class="demo-section demo-section--cream">
  <div class="demo-container demo-container--narrow">
    <span class="demo-eyebrow">04 &middot; Voice</span>
    <h2 class="demo-h2">Tone &amp; copy rules</h2>

    <div class="demo-prose">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Plain language, blue-collar confident.</strong> We speak like people who've been on roofs for twenty years, not like a marketing agency.</li>
        <li><strong>Specifics over adjectives.</strong> Not "the best roofers in town" &mdash; "$2M liability, license CO-RF-18432, 17 full-time W-2 employees."</li>
        <li><strong>Own the tradeoffs.</strong> We're not the cheapest and we say so. Trust is earned by being honest about what we aren't.</li>
        <li><strong>No exclamation marks.</strong> Ever. A calm voice during a storm is the product.</li>
        <li><strong>No industry jargon without translation.</strong> If we say "ice-and-water shield," we explain what it does on first use.</li>
        <li><strong>Phone number is always clickable and always prominent.</strong> On desktop and on mobile. Calls close deals, not forms.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

